Allow opt-in AppKit fullscreen for eligible game windows

Read the per-executable NativeGameWindow setting from Wine AppDefaults. Opted-in ordinary windows get the resizable AppKit style required for fullscreen. The free mode also removes the cursor clip while the game is windowed and releases it after leaving fullscreen.

Upstream: not sent.

